<%- include('partials/header') %>

  <div class="container mt-5 mb-5">
    <h1 class="mb-4">How It Works</h1>
    <p class="lead mb-4">Secrets is a safe, anonymous place to share what's on your mind.</p>

    <div class="row">
      <div class="col-md-6 mb-3">
        <div class="card h-100">
          <div class="card-body">
            <h5 class="card-title"><i class="fas fa-key"></i> You stay anonymous</h5>
            <p class="card-text">
              Your email is only used for logging in, it is <strong>never shown</strong> to anyone.
              When you share a secret, you get a fun auto generated alias like
              <em>SleepyFox417</em> so the community sees a name that reveals nothing about you.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="col-md-6 mb-3">
        <div class="card h-100">
          <div class="card-body">
            <h5 class="card-title"><i class="fas fa-key"></i> Your secret is private</h5>
            <p class="card-text">
              Only you can see the "My Secret" page. Everyone else only sees your secret
              (with your alias) on the <strong>Community Secrets</strong> list below it,
              never attached to your account.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="col-md-6 mb-3">
        <div class="card h-100">
          <div class="card-body">
            <h5 class="card-title"><i class="fas fa-key"></i> Update or delete anytime</h5>
            <p class="card-text">
              Change your secret whenever you want with <strong>Update My Secret</strong>.
              Changed your mind? <strong>Delete My Secret</strong> removes it for good, it
              disappears from the community list too, and you can submit a new one later.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="col-md-6 mb-3">
        <div class="card h-100">
          <div class="card-body">
            <h5 class="card-title"><i class="fas fa-key"></i> How you sign in</h5>
            <p class="card-text">
              Sign up with an email + password (passwords are hashed before storage) or
              sign in with Google. Sessions keep you logged in until you press
              <strong>Log Out</strong>.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

<div class="mt-4">
      <a class="btn btn-dark btn-lg" href="/register" role="button">Get Started</a>
    </div>

    <p class="text-muted mt-4">
      This is a personal learning project.
      <a href="https://github.com/Maxwellrubert/Secrets-Vault-Node.js-Authentication-Project" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
        View the source on GitHub.
      </a>
    </p>
  </div>

  <%- include('partials/footer') %>